{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40682","headline":"题竹溪禅院 · 李洞","name":"题竹溪禅院","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"溪边山一色，水拥竹千竿。\n鸟触翠微湿，人居酷暑寒。\n风摇缾影碎，沙陷履痕端。\n爽极青崖树，平流绿峡滩。\n闲来披衲数，涨後卷经看。\n三境通禅寂，嚣尘染着难。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李洞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40682.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40682","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}